    title: "elixir: use AppWeb, :live_view (the Phoenix web-module dispatcher) declares no behaviour and roots no LiveView callback -- 58 modules on plausible, 80 on livebook"  # abee
    status: todo_hard  # abee
    priority: 2  # abee
